%% Figure 6 — Comments, Attachments and History
flowchart LR
  User([Tester, assigned Developer or PM]) --> Detail[Fiori Bug Object Page]
  Detail --> Choice{Comment or\nattachment?}

  Choice -- Comment --> Comment[Submit comment\nand optional mentions]
  Comment --> CommentGuard{Bug open, actor allowed,\ncontent and mentions valid?}
  CommentGuard -- No --> CommentError[Safe 400/403 response\nNo mutation]
  CommentGuard -- Yes --> CommentTx[(Persist Comment)]
  CommentTx --> CommentHistory[Append comment HistoryEvent]
  CommentHistory --> Mention[Notify valid mentioned users\nwith applicable email delivery]

  Choice -- Attachment --> Draft[Edit Bug draft\nand attachment composition]
  Draft --> AttachmentGuard{Actor allowed; metadata,\nmedia type and size valid?}
  AttachmentGuard -- No --> AttachmentError[Safe 400/403 response\nNo active write]
  AttachmentGuard -- Yes --> Store[Store binary through\nconfigured S3 adapter]
  Store --> Metadata[(Keep attachment metadata\nin Bug draft)]
  Metadata --> Save[Save and activate Bug draft]
  Save --> Diff[Compare attachment metadata\nbefore and after SAVE]
  Diff --> AttachmentHistory[Append add/remove HistoryEvent\nwithout embedding binary]

  Mention --> Refresh[Refresh Comments and History sections]
  AttachmentHistory --> Refresh
  Refresh --> Result([Display persisted result])

